the poster and source geometry, not a claim to have replayed its original timing.

Original source specifies Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial but supplies no
font binaries. These commercial fonts are NOT bundled. Explicit substitutions:
Liberation Sans 2.1.5, unmodified, SIL OFL 1.1 (Google / Red Hat);
Archivo variable font, SIL OFL 1.1, Copyright 2020 The Archivo Project Authors.
Archivo derivatives are instantiated at weight 200 and 300, width 100, and renamed
SwissArchivo200 / SwissArchivo300. See font-provenance.json.
Source and generated font binaries remain under OFL, not Apache.
Percent suffix is independently constructed from circles and a quadrilateral;
text width, weight and vertical scale have explicit Native optical calibration.
Do not represent substituted glyphs as original Helvetica outlines.

No GSAP code, video, photo, Helvetica font, or Nimbus Sans is included in the
source overlay. Private raw source recovery is separate.
The full original preview is only in private comparison evidence, never loaded
by render.cjs. Detail crops are QA aids, never represented as complete works.

